  "description": "Yerim, a graduate student who always lacks sleep because she has to work for 30 people, suffers from insomnia. The way to solve this is to drink like crazy at a club and spend the night with a stranger. Then one day, as usual, I caught a man, and this man is strange. Now I have a strange mark on my cheek, so when pull it, the skin on my face comes off...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8618530), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3498022489), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000063646), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/onenight_skin)",
